## NPM RUN DEV

✅ 1. Modular render pass system refactor - COMPLETED
   - Refactored DeferredRenderer to use RenderPassManager
   - Refactored all lighting passes (point lights, spot lights) 
   - Refactored all post-processing components (ToneMappingComponent, AntialiasingComponent, AmbientOcclusionComponent)
   - Refactored utility passes (AmbientLight, Skybox, DepthResolver, GBufferPass)
   - Centralized viewport/scissor logic with GPUUtils.configureViewportAndScissor
   - Eliminated all manual beginRenderPass usage except BaseRenderPass (system base class)
   - All rendering now uses modular system with consistent configuration patterns
   - Fixed MSAA attachment compatibility issues 
   - ⚠️ Note: WebGPU validation warnings for texture usage conflicts (texture used as both RENDER_ATTACHMENT and TEXTURE_BINDING in same scope) - functionally works but could be optimized with double buffering in future

